      <div style="margin-top:28px">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px">When to split a PDF — common use cases</h2>
        <p style="font-size:0.875rem;color:#a1a1aa;line-height:1.75;margin:0">Splitting PDFs is useful in dozens of everyday situations: extracting a specific invoice page from a multi-page financial statement, separating chapters of a report to share with different teams, removing irrelevant pages before sending a document, splitting a large scanned archive into smaller files that fit within email size limits, or extracting a single form page from a large PDF package. ihatepdf's split tool handles all of these without any file upload.</p>
